{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國《華爾街日報》報道，美軍周一（2日）襲擊了伊朗位於霍爾木茲海峽的格什姆島，是美國近幾周來最新一次對伊朗進行「有限打擊」。</p><p>報道又表示，這次襲擊規模較小，而且刻意保密，避免外界以為美國恢復對伊朗採取大型軍事行動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:36.456797+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:36:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:20.130451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:33.347888+00:00","content_hash":"4b55cb0b6d60f9d87538ce8edcc0d2424559491b48fd1d13bc8d9945878a23c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}